From a6888cde8f6f89867a987bb60e9fdf11e53405cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex <05jeelo30@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:52:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Spoofify: Drop keybox spoofing and the Lineage resources

The onyx build only ships build property spoofing: drop the keybox
target and its default download, and the org.lineageos.settings.resources
library, which AOSPA doesn't have and the app doesn't use.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QY97AsgNLyAwQpzrsxC9zt
---
 Android.bp                                    |  1 -
 res/values/strings.xml                        | 13 +----
 src/com/grewal/spoofify/SpoofStatus.kt        | 54 -------------------
 src/com/grewal/spoofify/SpoofStore.kt         | 18 -------
 src/com/grewal/spoofify/SpoofTarget.kt        |  9 ----
 .../grewal/spoofify/SpoofTargetFragment.kt    |  1 -
 6 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 95 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index ecb4bb3..5a58bf9 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -16,7 +16,6 @@ android_app {
         "androidx.appcompat_appcompat",
         "androidx.core_core",
         "androidx.preference_preference",
-        "org.lineageos.settings.resources",
     ],
 }
 
